{"id":"b5c7b94c4e3c3168","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-image-subsheaf.md","title":"Definition — Image Subsheaf by Local Membership","display":"Definition — Image Subsheaf by Local Membership","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-image-subsheaf","aliases":["14-df-image-subsheaf"],"display":"Definition — Image Subsheaf by Local Membership","depends_on":["[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]","[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-image-subsheaf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-image-subsheaf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Image Subsheaf by Local Membership"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e21364f5dcced9e7\" href=\"?note=e21364f5dcced9e7\" title=\"14-df-site-sheaf-category\">14-df-site-sheaf-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"93ae791420c1822a\" href=\"?note=93ae791420c1822a\" title=\"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective\">14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal C,J)\">\\((\\mathcal C,J)\\)</span> 是小站点，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha:F\\to G\">\\(\\alpha:F\\to G\\)</span> 是层之间的自然变换。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_\\alpha\">\\(I_\\alpha\\)</span> 是下列子预层；其限制是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> 限制在所写子集上的箭头。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Im}\">\\(\\mathrm{Im}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4cd3b0d29b80beda\" href=\"?note=4cd3b0d29b80beda\" title=\"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity\">14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity</a> 的子对象像。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\nI_{\\alpha,0}(C)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in G(C)\\mid\\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ \\exists s\\in F(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\ (\\alpha_{\\mathrm{dom}(f)}(s)=G(f)(t))\\},\\\\\nI_{\\alpha,1}(g)\\coloneqq(I_{\\alpha,0}(C),I_{\\alpha,0}(D),(t\\mapsto G(g)(t)))\\qquad(g:D\\to C),\\\\\nI_\\alpha\\coloneqq(I_{\\alpha,0},I_{\\alpha,1}),\\qquad\n\\iota_\\alpha\\coloneqq(I_\\alpha,G,((I_{\\alpha,0}(C),G(C),(t\\mapsto t)))_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(I_\\alpha,\\mathcal C,J),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Im}(\\alpha)=[\\iota_\\alpha].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\nI_{\\alpha,0}(C)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in G(C)\\mid\\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ \\exists s\\in F(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\ (\\alpha_{\\mathrm{dom}(f)}(s)=G(f)(t))\\},\\\\\nI_{\\alpha,1}(g)\\coloneqq(I_{\\alpha,0}(C),I_{\\alpha,0}(D),(t\\mapsto G(g)(t)))\\qquad(g:D\\to C),\\\\\nI_\\alpha\\coloneqq(I_{\\alpha,0},I_{\\alpha,1}),\\qquad\n\\iota_\\alpha\\coloneqq(I_\\alpha,G,((I_{\\alpha,0}(C),G(C),(t\\mapsto t)))_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(I_\\alpha,\\mathcal C,J),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Im}(\\alpha)=[\\iota_\\alpha].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：III.6；III.8 Subsheaves。覆盖稳定性保证局部属于像的性质在限制后保持；局部性把局部的局部见证合并成覆盖见证，故该子预层满足层粘合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\to I_\\alpha\">\\(F\\to I_\\alpha\\)</span> 局部满，因而是满态射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_\\alpha\\to G\">\\(I_\\alpha\\to G\\)</span> 逐点包含而为单态射，所以得到正确的像分解。此定义明确展示“局部像”与单纯逐点像的区别。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-site-sheaf-category","status":"resolved","id":"e21364f5dcced9e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-site-sheaf-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective","status":"resolved","id":"93ae791420c1822a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-sheaf-epimorphisms-locally-surjective]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity","status":"resolved","id":"4cd3b0d29b80beda","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(\\mathcal C,J)$ 是小站点，$\\alpha:F\\to G$ 是层之间的自然变换。$I_\\alpha$ 是下列子预层；其限制是 $G$ 限制在所写子集上的箭头。$\\mathrm{Im}$ 是 [[14-thm-topos-image-factorization-and-regularity]] 的子对象像。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"(\\mathcal C,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha:F\\to G","display":false},{"tex":"I_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Im}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\nI_{\\alpha,0}(C)\\coloneqq\\{t\\in G(C)\\mid\\exists S\\in J(C)\\ \\forall f\\in S\\ \\exists s\\in F(\\mathrm{dom}(f))\\ (\\alpha_{\\mathrm{dom}(f)}(s)=G(f)(t))\\},\\\\\nI_{\\alpha,1}(g)\\coloneqq(I_{\\alpha,0}(C),I_{\\alpha,0}(D),(t\\mapsto G(g)(t)))\\qquad(g:D\\to C),\\\\\nI_\\alpha\\coloneqq(I_{\\alpha,0},I_{\\alpha,1}),\\qquad\n\\iota_\\alpha\\coloneqq(I_\\alpha,G,((I_{\\alpha,0}(C),G(C),(t\\mapsto t)))_{C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)}),\\\\\n\\mathrm{IsSheafOnSite}(I_\\alpha,\\mathcal C,J),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Im}(\\alpha)=[\\iota_\\alpha].\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"F\\to I_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"I_\\alpha\\to G","display":false}],"bytes":1746,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-110","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-image-subsheaf|Definition — Image Subsheaf by Local Membership]]"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-image-subsheaf]]"},{"id":"a4004ce206bd12ec","anchor":"ref-33","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-image-subsheaf]]"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-66","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-image-subsheaf]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-111","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-image-subsheaf|Definition — Image Subsheaf by Local Membership]]"}],"outgoing":["e21364f5dcced9e7","93ae791420c1822a","4cd3b0d29b80beda"]}